              "captureDate": "2026-07-30",
              "supportingExcerpt": "Section 1005, act Oct. 14, 1940, ch. 876, title III, § 705, as added Mar. 27, 1942, ch. 199, title X, § 1001, 56 Stat. 183, related to forms, rules and regulations. See section 1440 of this title.",
              "unlockGroupId": null
