              "captureDate": "2026-07-30",
              "supportingExcerpt": "Codification Section was enacted as part of the USA PATRIOT Improvment and Reauthorization Act of 2005, and not as part of the Immigration and Nationality Act which comprises this chapter.",
              "unlockGroupId": null
