              "supportingExcerpt": "Amendments2000—Subsec. (a)(2). Pub. L. 106–313, § 104(b)(1), substituted “paragraphs (3), (4), and (5)” for “paragraphs (3) and (4)”. Subsec. (a)(5). Pub. L. 106–313, § 104(a), added par. (5). Subsec. (e)(3). Pub. L. 106–313, § 104(b)(2), substituted “except as provided in subsection (a)(5), the proportion of the visa numbers” for “the proportion of the visa numbers”. 1996—Subsec. (a)(1). Pub. L. 104–208 designated existing provisions as subpar. (A) and added subpar. (B). 1991—Subsec. (a)(4)(A). Pub. L. 102–232 struck out “minimum” before “2nd preference set-aside” in heading. 1990—Subsec. (a)",
