            "topic": "priorProvisions",
            "heading": "Prior Provisions",
            "text": "Prior ProvisionsA prior section 1157, act June 27, 1952, ch. 477, title II, ch. 1, § 207, 66 Stat. 181, prohibited issuance of immigrant visas to other immigrants in lieu of immigrants excluded from admission, immigrants deported, immigrants failing to apply for admission to the United States, or immigrants found to be nonquota immigrants after having previously been found to be quota immigrants, prior to repeal by Pub. L. 89–236, § 7, Oct. 3, 1965, 79 Stat. 916.",
