              "captureDate": "2026-07-30",
              "supportingExcerpt": "Iraq Refugee CrisisPub. L. 110–181, div. A, title XII, subtitle C, Jan. 28, 2008, 122 Stat. 395, as amended by Pub. L. 110–242, § 1, June 3, 2008, 122 Stat. 1567; Pub. L. 111–84, div. A, title VIII, § 813(d), Oct. 28, 2009, 123 Stat. 2407; Pub. L. 111–118, div. A, title VIII, § 8120(a), Dec. 19, 2009, 123 Stat. 3457; Pub. L. 111–383, div. A, title X, § 1075(f)(9), (10), Jan. 7, 2011, 124 Stat. 4376; Pub. L. 113–42, § 1, Oct. 4, 2013, 127 Stat. 552; Pub. L. 113–66, div. A, title XII, § 1218, Dec. 26, 2013, 127 Stat. 910; Pub. L. 117–31, title IV, § 403(c), July 30, 2021, 135 Stat. 319, provided",
