            "heading": "Gender-Related Persecution Task Force",
            "text": "Gender-Related Persecution Task ForcePub. L. 106–113, div. B, § 1000(a)(7) [div. A, title II, § 254], Nov. 29, 1999, 113 Stat. 1536, 1501A–432, provided that: “(a) Establishment of Task Force.—The Secretary of State, in consultation with the Attorney General and other appropriate Federal agencies, shall establish a task force with the goal of determining eligibility guidelines for women seeking refugee status overseas due to gender-related persecution. “(b) Report.—Not later than 1 year after the date of the enactment of this Act [Nov. 29, 1999], the Secretary of State shall prepare and submit to the Congress a report outlining the guidelines determined by the task force under subsection (a).”",
