            "text": "Executive Order No. 14013 Ex. Ord. No. 14013, Feb. 4, 2021, 86 F.R. 8839, which related to rebuilding and enhancing programs to resettle refugees and planning for the impact of climate change on migration, was revoked by Ex. Ord. No. 14148, § 2(x), Jan. 20, 2025, 90 F.R. 8238, Ex. Ord. No. 14154, § 4(a)(v), Jan. 20, 2025, 90 F.R. 8354, and Ex. Ord. No. 14163, § 5, Jan. 20, 2025, 90 F.R. 8460.",
