            "heading": "Effective Date of 2005 Amendment",
            "text": "Effective Date of 2005 AmendmentPub. L. 109–13, div. B, title I, § 101(h)(1), (2), May 11, 2005, 119 Stat. 305, provided that: “(1) The amendments made by paragraphs (1) and (2) of subsection (a) [amending this section] shall take effect as if enacted on March 1, 2003. “(2) The amendments made by subsections (a)(3), (b), (c), and (d) [amending this section and sections 1229a and 1231 of this title] shall take effect on the date of the enactment of this division [May 11, 2005] and shall apply to applications for asylum, withholding, or other relief from removal made on or after such date.”",
