            "text": "Exclusion of Certain “J” Nonimmigrants From Numerical Limitations Applicable To “H–1B” NonimmmigrantsPub. L. 106–313, title I, § 114, Oct. 17, 2000, 114 Stat. 1262, provided that: “The numerical limitations contained in section 102 of this title [amending this section and enacting provisions set out as a note above] shall not apply to any nonimmigrant alien granted a waiver that is subject to the limitation contained in paragraph (1)(B) of the first section 214(l) of the Immigration and Nationality Act [8 U.S.C. 1184(l)] (relating to restrictions on waivers).”",
