            "topic": "miscellaneous",
            "heading": "Machine Readable Passports",
            "text": "Machine Readable PassportsPub. L. 107–56, title IV, § 417(a), (b), Oct. 26, 2001, 115 Stat. 355, required the Secretary of State to perform annual audits and submit reports relating to machine readable, counterfeit, and tamper-resistant passports until Sept. 30, 2007.",
