            "text": "Other Benefit RequestsPub. L. 116–159, div. D, title I, § 4102(c), Oct. 1, 2020, 134 Stat. 740, provided that: “In implementing the amendments made by subsection (a) [amending this section], the Secretary of Homeland Security shall develop and implement processes to ensure that the availability of premium processing, or its expansion to additional immigration benefit requests, does not result in an increase in processing times for immigration benefit requests not designated for premium processing or an increase in regular processing of immigration benefit requests so designated.”",
