              "supportingExcerpt": "Extension of Land Border Fee Pilot ProjectPub. L. 104–208, div. A, § 101(a) [title I], Sept. 30, 1996, 110 Stat. 3009, 3009–10, provided in part: “That the Land Border Fee Pilot Project scheduled to end September 30, 1996 [see subsec. (q) of this section], is extended to September 30, 1999, for projects on both the northern and southern borders of the United States, except that no pilot program may implement a universal land border crossing toll”. Similar provisions were contained in the following prior appropriations act: Pub. L. 103–121, title I, Oct. 27, 1993, 107 Stat. 1161, as amended by ",
