              "captureDate": "2026-07-30",
              "supportingExcerpt": "Codification Section was formerly set out as a note under section 1221 of this title. Section was enacted as part of the Illegal Immigration Reform and Immigrant Responsibility Act of 1996, and also as part of the Omnibus Consolidated Appropriations Act, 1997, and not as part of the Immigration and Nationality Act which comprises this chapter.",
              "unlockGroupId": null
