            "captureDate": "2026-07-30",
            "supportingExcerpt": "Pub. L. 103–416, § 1, Oct. 25, 1994, 108 Stat. 4305, provided that: “This Act [see Tables for classification] may be cited as the ‘Immigration and Nationality Technical Corrections Act of 1994’.”",
            "unlockGroupId": null
