            "captureDate": "2026-07-30",
            "supportingExcerpt": "Section 309 of the Illegal Immigration Reform and Immigrant Responsibility Act of 1996, referred to in subsecs. (b)(2)(B), (C), (4), and (e)(3)(A), is section 309 of title III of div. C of Pub. L. 104–208, which is set out as a note under section 1101 of this title.",
